{"4220030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chicago 4th of July", "steam_appid": 4220030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a <strong>near-future cyberpunk Chicago</strong> — a dazzling metropolis built on neon glamour, corporate power, and hidden control. Behind the city’s beauty lies <strong>the Veil</strong>, a mysterious force that distorts reality, erases truth, and keeps the population obedient.<br>When the Veil falters around you, forgotten memories awaken… and so do <strong>abilities you were never meant to possess</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a lone outsider in a <strong>story-rich action adventure</strong>, navigating a city where every alley hides danger, every skyscraper hides secrets, and every choice pulls you deeper into a <strong>sci-fi conspiracy</strong> that reshapes Chicago’s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>supernatural powers</strong>, <strong>high-tech firearms</strong>, stealth tactics, and fast movement as you uncover the truth behind the Veil — and face the forces determined to keep the city blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the open world, fight corporate enforcers, outsmart surveillance systems, and rise against a regime built to control every thought and every moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ <strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Supernatural &amp; Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash <strong>telekinesis, energy blasts, shadow abilities</strong>, and high-impact melee strikes in fast-paced, physics-driven battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔫 <strong>Dynamic Futuristic Gunplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <strong>sci-fi firearms</strong>, weapon mods, drones, gadgets, and hybrid combat abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏙️ <strong>Open-World Cyberpunk Chicago</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam a reimagined, neon-lit Chicago featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate districts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underground slums</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surveillance zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned rail yards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooftop traversal paths</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌀 <strong>The Veil — Reality Distortion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a mysterious force that:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alters perception</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hides the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulates memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes the city’s population</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>Story-Rich Conspiracy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a layered narrative filled with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betrayal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Political manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate warfare</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧗 <strong>Parkour &amp; High-Speed Mobility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, vault, wall-run, slide, and sprint across rooftops and alleys using smooth, responsive <strong>parkour movement</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👁️ <strong>Stealth &amp; Shadow Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into the environment, hack systems, use silent takedowns, and manipulate darkness to stay unseen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎭 <strong>A Beautiful Yet Oppressive World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a neon city built on glamour, inequality, control, and the illusion of freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Full Controller Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play comfortably with <strong>gamepad</strong> or <strong>keyboard + mouse</strong>.</p>", "about_the_ga