"bb_paragraph\" >Surveillance zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned rail yards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooftop traversal paths</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌀 <strong>The Veil — Reality Distortion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a mysterious force that:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alters perception</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hides the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulates memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes the city’s population</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>Story-Rich Conspiracy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a layered narrative filled with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betrayal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Political manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate warfare</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧗 <strong>Parkour &amp; High-Speed Mobility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, vault, wall-run, slide, and sprint across rooftops and alleys using smooth, responsive <strong>parkour movement</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👁️ <strong>Stealth &amp; Shadow Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into the environment, hack systems, use silent takedowns, and manipulate darkness to stay unseen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎭 <strong>A Beautiful Yet Oppressive World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a neon city built on glamour, inequality, control, and the illusion of freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Full Controller Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play comfortably with <strong>gamepad</strong> or <strong>keyboard + mouse</strong>.</p>", "short_description": "Chicago 4th of July is an open-world, action-adventure RPG set in a near-future Chicago — a glamorous yet oppressive megacity wrapped in a mysterious Veil. Uncover the truth behind the Veil, navigate a world ruled by power and rise against a system built to keep you blind.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Tamil<strong>*</strong>, Telugu<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220030/c583971201d2b6ca043b66ddfe0daa7343fa9499/header.jpg?t=1780064108", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220030/86249a94177735a88f2569ba2da37eb6f1b02d07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780064108", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220030/86249a94177735a88f2569ba2da37eb6f1b02d07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780064108", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB or AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Runs best on SSD.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / RTX 3060 or AMD RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD highly recommended.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 (Intel Only build not recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 GPU or AMD Radeon Pro 560X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard audio device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Apple Silicon supported (M1 / M2 / M3). Runs best on SSD.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13 Ventura or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M2 or Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M2 GPU or AMD Radeon Pro 5500M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard audio device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Apple Silicon native performance recommended.</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 / SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (Driver 470+) or AMD RX 580 (Mesa 21+)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any ALSA-compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Vulkan required. Runs best on SSD.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 / SteamOS 3.5<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / 3060 (Driver 535+) or AMD RX 5700 XT (Mesa 23+)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any ALSA-compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Vulkan required. SSD recommended.</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Clumsy Boy Studios"], "publishers": ["Clumsy Boy Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 13, "description": "Captions available"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 44, "description": "Remote Play Together"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220030/ebf34d202438dcc5384979dee966db1b03dfc877/ss_ebf34d202438dcc5384979dee966db1b03dfc877.600x338.jpg?t=1780064108", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220030/ebf34d202438dcc5384979dee966db1b03dfc877/ss_ebf34d202438dcc5384979dee966db1b03dfc877.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780064108"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220030/abad80d30b120d601b74b990c64ed981ae5ae8be/ss_abad80d30b120d601b74b990c64ed981ae5ae8be.600x338.jpg?t=1780064108", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220030/abad80d30b120d601b74b990c64ed981ae5ae8be/ss_abad80